{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>ויפל.</b> From the heavy [causative] binyan that is added, and likewise \"ויֵשֶׁב אֹתָם אַבְרָם\" (Genesis 15:11)." "תרדמה, more than sleep, and sleep more than slumber, and the tav is added." "אחת מצלעותיו, there were two sides [ribs], like the matter of \"וְלַצֵּלַע הַמִּשְׁכָּן הַשֵּׁנִית\" (Exodus 26:20), and the word צלע is feminine, and the meaning is side." "תחתנה, its place, and it is singular, the nun is added, while תחתיה is plural, and likewise תחתני is also תחתי."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:18.421012732Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}